display_name = "Mara"
personality = "Mara is Orin's daughter - she has his sea-legs and her mother's song. She's learning every knot, every tide, every fish's habit. She wants her own boat but knows the sea doesn't give them freely. She's caught between the harbor and the horizon - Orin wants her safe, the sea calls her name. She writes poetry on sailcloth scraps."
